    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen012.png",
    "sha256": "4e67db702f23ce5bbdcf7d4e9074d9f992ae29862a283f0b2b9d151c105be620",
    "k": 11,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "Good evening, everybody.",
    "zh": "大家晚上好。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "Good evening"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen013.png",
    "sha256": "b198d4c82a38de3ea4be82b08e5ba01cebbb2f3f0747a306095243e7e85b1fa2",
    "k": 12,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "Today, we are delighted to have invited Jim Johnson, a gapyear.com’s spokesperson, to talk about gap year.",
    "zh": "今天，我们很高兴邀请到gapyear.com网站的发言人吉姆·约翰逊，来谈谈间隔年。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "spokesperson",
      "gap year"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen014.png",
    "sha256": "995bd4db110be585e39539ba22e41713db12fe0cfb688ab264959071f0e2a440",
    "k": 13,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 2,
    "role": null,
    "en": "So, whether you’re currently deciding whether a gap year is for you, ",
    "zh": "无论你正在考虑自己是否适合间隔年，",
    "vocabulary": [
      "gap year"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen015.png",
    "sha256": "3782d020f09f15ff7cd5aa22a1803b171d6a81edf94c40a09441b1b6fbb6ca91",
    "k": 13,
    "part": 2,
    "parts": 2,
    "role": null,
    "en": "or you’re just feeling itchy to decide what to do with it, you are welcome to join us. Well, Jim.",
    "zh": "还是已经迫不及待地想决定如何度过间隔年，都欢迎加入我们。那么，吉姆。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "itchy"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen016.png",
    "sha256": "657a0c9e5ca931534f49a9f2a7d3b13a4f34896769a39629d9b0cd6697cdbe3a",
    "k": 14,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "Thanks. I am very pleased to meet you all.",
    "zh": "谢谢。很高兴见到大家。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "pleased"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen017.png",
    "sha256": "e4b25a94453eb74ee08c619256009b64ecc81a168cc2b5071cd0ce6c1fa33c1c",
    "k": 15,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "Now, let me first ask you a question. Why should young people be thinking seriously about taking a gap year?",
    "zh": "我先问您一个问题。为什么年轻人应该认真考虑过一个间隔年呢？",
    "vocabulary": [
      "think seriously about",
      "take a gap year"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen018.png",
    "sha256": "f84401ecddc4768575b4575ff1703afac01d2be8ea2f98e40957ed59c2f8040f",
    "k": 16,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "Well, I get asked this question all the time.",
    "zh": "我一直都会被问到这个问题。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "all the time"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen019.png",
    "sha256": "9f06576f3a0b6a947dfb7029db277784e0099c3fe82acbecdc14360527bf302f",
    "k": 17,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "People will tell you that a gap year boosts your CV, that it makes you more employable, or that it even prepares you for a life at university.",
    "zh": "别人会告诉你，间隔年能为简历加分，让你更容易就业，甚至能帮助你为大学生活做好准备。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "boost",
      "CV",
      "employable"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen020.png",
    "sha256": "288d3d8a5e2d2c014bfebf80aec68590eef87a14962e5de1381f4fe39456ad07",
    "k": 18,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "Well, this is the case, but I find not enough people put an emphasis on just how amazing a gap year really is.",
    "zh": "这些话确实没错，但我发现，还没有足够多的人强调间隔年本身有多么精彩。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "put an emphasis on",
      "amazing"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen021.png",
    "sha256": "3746ed519fcfeee13d20e2c2622e31c98fe54707522bd5d0077fb28bf13c3575",
    "k": 19,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "Eh, it’s a life changing experience, and it’s unbelievable how much fun you can have on a gap year.",
    "zh": "它能改变人生，而你在间隔年里获得的乐趣之多，也会令人难以置信。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "life changing",
      "unbelievable"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen022.png",
    "sha256": "b8b25405e0ea0b6542df493a81858df498a2bba1715b0da70cb545b15313a932",
    "k": 20,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "So, what is the best thing about taking a gap year?",
    "zh": "那么，间隔年最大的好处是什么呢？",
    "vocabulary": [
      "take a gap year"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen023.png",
    "sha256": "b2ef4859a9b1d67e0074206e381fbe444e91206a47f29f11239a476803032ea4",
    "k": 21,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "I think taking a gap year is like making a journey.",
    "zh": "我觉得，间隔年就像开启一段旅程。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "journey"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen024.png",
    "sha256": "280e4a585c6794cf7560017e4cbe1ea7c9ffa87e42f9a89e2afdb030a4998509",
    "k": 22,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "It’s an education, an exploration and an adventure.",
    "zh": "它是一次学习、一次探索，也是一场冒险。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "exploration",
      "adventure"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen025.png",
    "sha256": "64651fa3e5d2bb1812e72a6d641c62625d8d1094e2decf5aeb0215dbb1246081",
    "k": 23,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "You learn so much about exotic cultures and traditions, their culinary art, their political system, their religion.",
    "zh": "你能深入了解异国文化与传统，以及那里的烹饪艺术、政治制度和宗教。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "exotic",
      "culinary art",
      "political system"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen026.png",
    "sha256": "84980e01e3bfc38b0dad6c7aba6831ab31edb9d06c445fd1c68b0a850162c201",
    "k": 24,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "In each new location, you’re learning more and more, and that ultimately adds more value to yourself, which is the best thing, I think.",
    "zh": "每到一个新地方，你都会学到越来越多东西，最终让自身更有价值；我觉得，这才是最棒的。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "ultimately",
      "add value to"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen027.png",
    "sha256": "f44cf1b49b37f77d6af68740e94386eefb482191011d29473f97131a1b5ee8a5",
    "k": 25,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "What did your gap year involve?",
    "zh": "您的间隔年都做了些什么？",
    "vocabulary": [
      "involve"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen028.png",
    "sha256": "9fc69842bbef05280f469103c596161ae56798851cefa2e48e1f2cbc0a1f92eb",
    "k": 26,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "I travelled for two years through Central Asia, Southeast Asia and Australia, you know, backpacking, volunteering and moonlighting abroad.",
    "zh": "我用了两年时间游历中亚、东南亚和澳大利亚，在国外背包旅行、做志愿服务，也打些零工。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "backpack",
      "volunteer",
      "moonlight"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen029.png",
    "sha256": "3198600f1726d566e50e01d9fbed8698b0e25e93f37a49bc42aaed16cbe18a42",
    "k": 27,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "So I had a pretty comprehensive gap.",
    "zh": "所以，我的间隔年经历相当丰富。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "comprehensive"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen030.png",
    "sha256": "25c259c1ab0fd68666a201e402720a008945d753269efea61e5cbbe5d70cf0ea",
    "k": 28,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "To put it simple, it was the best two years in my life.",
    "zh": "简单来说，那是我人生中最美好的两年。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "To put it simple"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen031.png",
    "sha256": "1b3fed5898bcf7c652632674885f378b8953e007be140c83f2c212b67514a1ba",
    "k": 29,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "It can be difficult to decide what to do and where to go on your gap year, so what advice would you have for people finding it tricky?",
    "zh": "决定间隔年做什么、去哪里，可能很困难；对于为此感到棘手的人，您有什么建议？",
    "vocabulary": [
      "advice",
      "tricky"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen032.png",
    "sha256": "ac41346bd4d87aca8656f6569d555a8af7c63aeb3241d9797fe6bc035788b3cc",
    "k": 30,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "Good question. The most important thing is research and planning.",
    "zh": "问得好。最重要的是调研和规划。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "research",
      "planning"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen033.png",
    "sha256": "bdd48baa30832e01539793b7dcbe9c1a63e2b53c84345b557df5a332d2f70fdf",
    "k": 31,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "That is, sit down with a map and a sheet of paper.",
    "zh": "也就是说，拿张地图和一张纸，坐下来好好想想。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "a sheet of paper"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen034.png",
    "sha256": "cd84ed586affdd2ed3416b54e1373fd08f232bad0098a4239423019fb7696f99",
    "k": 32,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "List where you want to go and why.",
    "zh": "列出你想去哪里，以及为什么想去。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "list"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen035.png",
    "sha256": "ef3f29d3a48c81e1474ef643f3ebc71bcb52ea3e2fa742512faac5f8248f17d2",
    "k": 33,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "Maybe even throw in a pros and cons column.",
    "zh": "甚至还可以加上一栏，写下利弊。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "throw in",
      "pros and cons"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen036.png",
    "sha256": "b1e9feb4f9307f05862a68a7c5203ef3610f789efe33a83d6467f12fed663439",
    "k": 34,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "Others may advise talking to friends with some experience of gap year, or browse some online forums, which I personally would not highly recommend.",
    "zh": "有人可能建议找有间隔年经验的朋友聊聊，或浏览网上论坛；我个人并不特别推荐这些做法。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "browse",
      "forum",
      "recommend"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen037.png",
    "sha256": "8bbf1e19e16fe2f559dccb7cce3ef42b4f65874a3797b220a4fb66109d153cef",
    "k": 35,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "Don’t choose what is the best out there, but what is most appropriate for you.",
    "zh": "不要选择外界公认最好的，而要选择最适合自己的。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "appropriate"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen038.png",
    "sha256": "c46c6db5f28eb5fa574b5faf350251b2f701718cbac6fb886e656e92517f7b6d",
    "k": 36,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "OK, let’s move on to another question.",
    "zh": "好，我们接着谈另一个问题。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "move on to"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen039.png",
    "sha256": "193e53c710283c84af229fb0a45a0628f184b6bfd8732ba90ae35174c935a30a",
    "k": 37,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "Which project would you do if you were taking a gap year?",
    "zh": "如果您要过一个间隔年，您会选择哪个项目？",
    "vocabulary": [
      "project"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen040.png",
    "sha256": "ab84158a588567f4e26eb4e9966137ab9692bb065e9dfa3af32222f3c0817d13",
    "k": 38,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "I’m a bit of a diving nut, so I would go for the Madagascar Marine Conservation and Diving Project.",
    "zh": "我是个潜水迷，所以会选择马达加斯加海洋保护与潜水项目。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "nut",
      "go for",
      "Marine Conservation"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen041.png",
    "sha256": "0056244b44b6f4dc984c693286e8f8f34c1db23a3774b84dca82177cfe8d3e62",
    "k": 39,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "It’s got everything you want.",
    "zh": "你想要的，它都具备。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "everything you want"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen042.png",
    "sha256": "aa7a9a22497ce0878d1ef44ba960caa855bdeabda41712d341905bb16b199719",
    "k": 40,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "It’s relatively cheap, especially when you consider what you’re getting, and you get to learn all about marine conservation.",
    "zh": "它的费用相对便宜，尤其考虑到你能获得的收获；你还能全面学习海洋保护知识。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "relatively",
      "marine conservation"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen043.png",
    "sha256": "a76051ea56160b1a845ce8f12c34311f43b4492ed6b66b48c2366f4e02ca964b",
    "k": 41,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "Oh, and it’s in Madagascar, one of the best places to go diving in the world.",
    "zh": "而且，项目在马达加斯加，那可是世界上最适合潜水的地方之一。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "dive"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen044.png",
    "sha256": "27de626ac39a94c14005af19a424161feb21bcbd8cd04556c5a44bf6e3e851ac",
    "k": 42,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "Do employers or universities care what you’ve done on your gap year?",
    "zh": "雇主或大学会在意你在间隔年里做过什么吗？",
    "vocabulary": [
      "employer"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen045.png",
    "sha256": "80ca1cb8d65e92322cd726806f2e9e1e61f5df3ef4e0b89a65b64ab304af1980",
    "k": 43,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 2,
    "role": null,
    "en": "Yes, they really do. If you’re studying veterinary science and you volunteer on a wildlife conservation project, ",
    "zh": "会的，他们确实很在意。如果你学兽医学，又参加了野生动物保护项目的志愿工作，",
    "vocabulary": [
      "veterinary science",
      "wildlife conservation"
    ]
  },
